window.products.push({"id":494059,"name":"Concrete Tabletop Fire Pit,Portable Ethanol Fireplace,Mini Personal Fireplace,Table top Fireplace,Smores Maker,Rubbing Alcohol Fire Bowl Pot for Indoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c4cvTgLsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT IS THE TABLETOP FIRE PIT TO YOU? Natural? Safety and easy to use? Large flame?smokeless? How about something that combines the functionality of all of the above. We are confident in recommending this mini fire pit. INSTANT AMBIANCE OF A REAL FIRE: This portable fire pit is easy to use with no mess, or clean-up.Watching the flame flicker and dance is an instant mood booster, and soul soother. No better way to spend time with family and friends than sitting around a real fire. SAFE TO COOK: It is a great for cooking s'mores, We have prepared two BBQ forks for you. We recommend 91% isopropyl alcohol (or ethanol) as fuel, And because there’s no smoke or odor, There’s no soot, or weird taste on your marshmallow. EASY TO USE: This tabletop fireplace does not require electricity, natural gas or chimneys are required because it uses simple rubbing alcohol as fuel , Can be used indoor or outdoor. This flame lasts approximately 45 minutes, Make sure it is completely extinguished before you pour in the fuel again and light it up. SPECIAL CONCRETE: Normal concrete can not be burned by high temperature, We use a special high-temperature resistant concrete with explosion-proof fiber, Which is safe and durable with a heat resistance of 3000℉. So we don't need to put a cheap stainless steel cup inside, Because that will destroy the natural concrete style. UNIQUE GIFT: We come with a special box that you can write her (his) name on it, can be as a Christmas gift or other gift, we sure it will impress your family or friends, and light up their world!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c4cvTgLsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"horpait","source_asin":"B0BVV861YJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVV861YJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVV861YJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
