window.products.push({"id":494109,"name":"Tango Perfect Sit & Sleep Pocketed Coil Inner Spring Pillow Top Sofa Sleeper Bed, Chair-size, Microfiber Suede Khaki Upholstery","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nvXNAkfeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Serving as the perfect sofa during the day and the perfect bed at night, the Perfect Sit & Sleep provides the ultimate in versatility and comfort. Available in an array of kid-proof pet-proof Microfiber Suede and Leather Look fabric options to fit your home decor. Perfect for the spare room, rec room, cottage, cabin, office, family room, living room, bedroom, and kid's room. Superior medium to firm sitting and sleeping comfort with minimal motion transfer provided by dense pocketed 6-inch high coils (full-size 540 coils, queen-size 621 coils, and chair-size 200 coils). Very durable frame with metal-to-metal connections for strength and durability that will handle up to 750 pounds of distributed weight. Durable hinge mechanism provides an easy convert from sitting to sleeping and back. For even and consistent mattress support, the seat and back decks feature a black steel alloy grid style; no feeling the bars ever. Lifetime sofa sleeper due to both a cleanable and replaceable cover set; never have a redecorating problem, simply buy a new cover set in another color. When, after a very long time, the cover is worn, simply replace it. Upholstered both front and back for attractive center of room placement with front and back tailored decorative skirts. Features an EZ fold mattress with no unsightly fabric bunching. Includes two matching accent pillows. Innovative engineering enables sofa to fit through any doorway or up narrow stairways. Full and queen sizes sleep two and sits three adults comfortably; chair-size sits one adult comfortably and sleeps one child. Uses standard bedding. Sleeping area dimensions: full-size 54” wide by 75” long, queen-size 60” wide by 80” long, child-size 28” wide by 54”. Sit position dimensions: all sizes 20” to top of mattress, 23” arm height, 20” seat height; 38” deep; full-size 38” back height, 90” wide; queen-size 44” back height, 95” wide. Assembly required. Live and email assembly assistance, as well as assembly videos available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nvXNAkfeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Epic Furnishings","source_asin":"B00E5UO9IK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E5UO9IK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E5UO9IK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
