window.products.push({"id":494111,"name":"Tableclothsfactory 14ft FULL SIZE 8 Layer Fluffy Tulle - Tutu Table Skirt - Rose Quartz Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qa90oQXOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jazz up your plain tablecloth by adding some pretty puffy tulle. The sheer fabric and divine softness of Tulle will impart a soft and dreamy feel to your party display. With the natural femininity and elegance held by Tulle, it has always been a top choice for girls of all ages. Your birthday girl will simply love her birthday table dressed in matching tulle, complementing her fairy-like tutu. Whether its a sweet 16 party, Quinceanera celebration, Bridal shower, baby shower, Holiday-themed parties or a wedding festivity, glam your dessert tables or cake tables with yards and yards of soft tulle, oozing the oodles of comeliness to your party space. Besides parties and special events, you can use Tulle skirts to beautify your little girls bedroom, wrapping a vanity, play table or a night stand. Even your big girls desk will look amazingly adorable with lush tulle wrapped around it gracefully. Choose the size and color that matches with your room décor or with your events color scheme. With layers and layers of soft, sheer tulle swathed around your wedding, reception, banquet, and party tables, your party will attain the highest level of delicate sophistication and surreal festive mood. Additional Information: Material: Tulle Total 8 layers once skirt is fully fluffed Size: 14ft wide x 29\" tall *note: sale is for 1-pc table skirt only. Fairy lighting and additional fabric bolts NOT INCLUDED. Guideline to choosing the right size: 14ft Skirts - Covers 3 sides on a 6ft x 2 1/2ft banquet tablep; ( similar to the ones you find in Costco)p; - 10 clips recommended 17ft Skirts - Coversp;4 sides on a 6ft x 2 1/2ft banquet tablep; ( similar to the ones you find in Costco)p; - 15 clips recommended Covers 3 sides on a 8ft x 2 1/2ft banquet table 21ft - Covers 4 sides on a 8ft x 2 1/2ft banquet table - 24 clips minimum needed - 20 clips recommended NOTE: all table skirts come with velcro on top for attachment to clips. (CLIPS ARE SOLD SEPARATELY)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qa90oQXOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TABLECLOTHSFACTORY.COM","source_asin":"B075X1WFM1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075X1WFM1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075X1WFM1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
