window.products.push({"id":494190,"name":"Electric Mini Garlic Chopper, 2 PCS Garlic Mincer Chopper, 45W High Power Portable Garlic Blender Mini Chopper Food Processor with Spoon, Food Chopper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kFuwFeSiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Chooise our food slicer and chopper? 1)Easy to Use: Press the button on the top and it will chopped your food automatically. 2)Save Time:45w super power, which can help you easily mash all kinds of ingredients. Great Kitchen Helper. 3)No mixed taste: our Electric Chopper has a 300ml and a 150ml cup, Meat and vegetables can be minced in different cups, safer and hygienic. 4) Easy to Clean: The mini chopper contains 3 parts: Lid, 3 Blades, Bowl. The 3 parts can be seperated so that you can clean easily. 5)Rechargeable: The food cutter is powered by USB. Very convenient for you to power it. Usually, charging 2 hours can last for 1 month. 6)Use it Anywhere: Electric mini Chopper It is just as useful out of the kitchen, as it is in the kitchen. Use garlic press while camping, barbecuing or anywhere you wish. ? This small chopper can be a very good gift for mom, girlfriend. You can regard it as a great gift and give your mom in Every festival: Mother's Day, Christmas etc. ?Specification: Power: 45W Rated input voltage: 6V Battery: 1800mA Capacity: 150ml/300ml(5oz/10oz) Waterproof: all body is waterproof. Switch: one touch button to turn on or off. Function: cutting vegetables, minced meat, stirring, mixing ?Packing: 1 Main part of the Mini Garlic Chopper 1 150ml Cup(2-leaf blade) 1 300ml Cup(3-leaf blade) 1 2-in-1 Spoon & brush 1 USB charging cable 1 User manual Tips for Use 1. Please fully charge the mainframe for first use. After full charging, the blue indicator will be normally on. 2. It is necessary to cover the lid in the right way. The electric Garlic Masher will not work if the cover is not on the right place. 3. To avoid fracture, don't put the mini gadget into micro-wave for heating or refrigerator for freezing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kFuwFeSiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ecam","source_asin":"B08NXLKZGP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NXLKZGP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NXLKZGP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
