window.products.push({"id":494195,"name":"OCR SILVER NAPKIN HOLDERW/GOLD","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R2GomSUWL._AC_.jpg","description":"This particular pattern is one of the most beloved and cherished patterns of all time. Designed by Harold Holdcroft in 1896.... His inspiration came from an English Rose Garden in full bloom...The patterns has been in production ever since ..The longest running single pattern of all time... Royal Albert is one of the world's best selling bone china brands and accounts for nearly 20% of the entire world market for English bone china...Royal Albert's \"Old Country Roses\" tabelware and teaware designs are one of the most popular bone china patterns of all time, selling over 150 million pieces since its introduction in 1962. If put end to end, the total production of Old Country Roses since introduction would stretch over 10,000 miles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R2GomSUWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Godinger","source_asin":"B000ZLK8YC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ZLK8YC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ZLK8YC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":494196,"name":"Eximius Power - Beer bottle Coolies with Extra thick Neoprene insulator - Premium Pack of 6 in assorted color Sleeves With Zipper Collapsible (6, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TWB+jyb-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for the perfect coolie sleeves that keep your drinks cold? Coolies that are quality and look stylish, besides doing their function as drink holders? Mission accomplished! Introducing the Beer Bottle Party Drink Thermal Coolies by Eximius Power. Featuring premium insulation with thicker Neoprene and sturdy zip for a snug fit, the 12 coolies included in this value pack are everything you ever dreamed of. They keep drinks cold, look exquisite and come in different vibrant colors for easier identification of each person’s drinks (especially handy at parties & similar events). Enjoy your drinks like you truly deserve and take your drinking experience to a whole new level with these supreme beer bottle thermal coolies! Using a sturdy zipper, you can conveniently open and seal the drink sleeves perfectly (even with the snug fit). Masterfully stitched and designed, the bottle cooler sleeve features a Neoprene bottom that will not leave water rings and helps the bottle to stay straight. Fits default 12 oz long-neck beer & soft drink bottles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TWB+jyb-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eximius Power","source_asin":"B01MZ25H1D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZ25H1D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MZ25H1D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
