window.products.push({"id":494208,"name":"yescool Wearable Blanket Hoodie, Oversized Sherpa Hooded Blanket Sweatshirt, Giant Warm Fuzzy Fleece Lounging Blanket with Hood Sleeves Pocket, Soft C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JFnxKLsgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MOVE FREELY IN THE COLD DAY】The wearable blanket hoodie which is warmer, and fuzzy is here! When you want to participate in the long-awaited camping and watch a romantic movie or an exciting live match at night, or take your puppy out in the morning, always feeling cold? No worries! We use more warm 180 GSM of flannel and 200GSM of sherpa fleece blanket sweatshirt, soft and fluffy to the touch. Keep temperature inward and block cold air outward.—SAY GOODBYE TO THE COLD! 【EASILY TURN INTO A PILLOW, PACKABLE】Hoodie blanket inconvenient to carry! Takes up a lot of space! Are you worried about this kind of problem? Yescool added a shoulder strap design based on the ordinary oversized hoodie sweatshirt blanket in the market! The hoodie blankets can be used indoors, in the car, outdoors, and on other occasions. When you do not need it can be folded into a small pillow, which can be a hand warmer, you can also use it to enjoy a comfortable sleep! -LIKE A SHOULDER BAG! 【UNIQUE MULTI-POCKET DESIGN】Blanket sweater pockets big enough! Only need to open the zipper, it can hold notebooks, books, snacks, and other things you need. The zipper design protects them from falling. Large pockets of giant sweatshirt blankets can also give your puppy and kitten a warm hug! However, cozy pocket too big to find the phone? We have added a small pocket, the phone on the small pocket at any time can get!—A POCKET TAKES ALL! 【CHOOSE FOR MATCHING COUPLE/FAMILY OUTFITS】One size fits both women and men. Multi-color reversible wearable blanket sweatshirt with hood and large pocket can be matched with couple outfits and parent-child outfits. Choose the same or different color matching wearable blankets with your husband/wife and your kids together. —GET A FAMILY PORTRAIT WITH MATCHING FAMILY WEARABLE BLANKETS! 【BEST GIFTS IDEAS EVER】Multi-color wearable blanket sweatshirt , Very suitable as Christmas, Thanksgiving, Valentines day gifts, adult wearable blanket as mens gifts for Father’s Day, And blanket sweatshirt for women, Mother’s Day, or birthdays as gifts for mom, wife, husband, kids, friends. And Machine washable, water temperature below 86℉is preferred, and then let oversized blanket hoodie dry naturally at low temperature, without ironing or expensive cleaning! —GUARD PEOPLE YOU LOVE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JFnxKLsgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yescool","source_asin":"B096DKZV3R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096DKZV3R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096DKZV3R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":494209,"name":"Bialetti Aeternum Red 7311 Oblong Cake Pan, 13-inch x 9-inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kS-N3ejPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create the perfect cake with this Aeternum 13-inch Oblong Cake pan from Bialetti. The Aeternum bakeware collection features durable, heavy-gauge aluminized steel construction and a red, high-temp non-stick exterior making it the ideal piece to go from kitchen to table. The bakeware's white ceramic interior is designed for easy release and better browning. This earth-friendly pan is PTFE, PFOA, and Cadmium-free, and unlike other nonstick bakeware, Aeternum's nonstick coating will not become absorbed in your food. Large handle design provides better control and a secure grip for ease of use. Made of heavy gauge steel and is oven safe up to 400-degrees F. With Aeternum ceramic coating, always use a little oil or butter when baking foods. For best results, hand wash with non-abrasive cleansers and liquid dishwashing soap. Use only nylon, wood, or high temperature silicone tools. In order to guarantee the best performance, avoid sharp pointed metal utensils that could scratch or ruin the nonstick surface. Do not use knives or small appliances such as electric mixer to chop or mix food if your cookware. Such use can damage the interior surface and void the warranty. Bialetti began in Italy, but has become a leading brand around the world for its high-quality products bringing simplicity, functionality and beauty to the kitchen. Bialetti's advanced technology and distinctive styling combine to create cookware that's simple to use and simply beautiful. Bialetti is authentically Italian, where the kitchen is the heart of the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kS-N3ejPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bialetti","source_asin":"B00LHT6N40","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LHT6N40","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LHT6N40","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
