window.products.push({"id":494269,"name":"Cuisiland Seasoned 10 Quart Cast Iron Potjiekos","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZaYx6qJPL._AC_SL1417_.jpg","description":"Since the Iron-age, the cast iron potjiekos was not only used for cooking, but also shrouded in mystery because witches and druids favored these pots for their rituals and ceremonies. Ideally designed for cooking over an open fire, the round belly three legged pot was created during this age. In the mid 1600’s, early explorers who used these pots exclusively on their expeditions, brought the tradition and style of the potjiekos pot to Africa. The Africans, after seeing the practicality of the cast iron pot, were quick to trade animals, hides and other commodities, to replace clay pots that were usually used for cooking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZaYx6qJPL._AC_SL1417_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisiland","source_asin":"B07GX37F9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GX37F9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GX37F9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":494270,"name":"Mortar and Pestle, 7 inch, 4 Cup Capacity, Natural Granite with Unpolished Natural Stone Bowl for Grinding Guacamole, Herbs, Pesto, Spices and Seasoni","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ghks-9rwL._AC_.jpg","description":"This mortar and pestle let you crush whole spices and fresh herbs with precision. mortar and pestle are made of unpolished genuine granite that provides rough-textured interior allowing to crush and grind ingredients effectively.  Manually grind, crush, mash, mince, press, pound, powder, and pulverize nuts, seeds, herbs, spices, and roots to release their flavor & aroma. Create your own savoury sauces, pastes, marinades.  Features: ● 4-cup capacity ● 7-inch length pestle ● Pure unpolished granite ● Includes easy garlic peeler  Specifications: Material: 100% natural granite Color: natural color Uses: Making pesto, barbecue sauce, guacamole, curry sauce, grinding herbs, spices, etc. Cleaning method: After use, just rinse with warm water Product Size: 7inch x 4.3inch Capacity: 4Cup Package includes: Granite mortar and pestle set *1  Warm Tips: It is important, before using your pestle and mortar bowl for the first time, that you clean and season both pieces. This will clean out any stone dust left in the items from when it was manufactured.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ghks-9rwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FiiMan","source_asin":"B0983MZ9BY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0983MZ9BY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0983MZ9BY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
