window.products.push({"id":494286,"name":"Olive Oil Dispenser Bottle with Brush for Kitchen,Silicone Measuring Dropper 18.6oz Glass Oil Bottle Container Wide Mouth Easy Refill Oil Sprayer for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ljr6bfE1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3 in 1 Oil Bottle】High temperature resistant(up to 482℉) silicone dropper and brush of the olive oil bottle are made of food grade PP, no odor, no lint,no deformation, strong toughness, and the bottle body is made of thick texture borosilicate glass, transparent and bright bottle allows you to clearly see the oil in the bottle. 【Convenient to Use】Independent brush heads with 3 layer of the olive oil spray bottle can help you spread food evenly, you just need to pinch the dripper gently to suck the oil into the oil storage tank and apply it to your food. 304 stainless steel oil nozzle with 77° inclined design, smooth oil flow, no oil dripping and no oil hanging. With a non-slip handle allows for easy one-handed pouring. 【Precise scale】Pawcute oil dispenser bottle with precise scale storage tank and funnel bottle cap. The precise scale allows you to control the quantitative oil output, get less oil consumption and healthier eating. Moreover, funnel reflux design also avoids waste and overflow, while also ensuring the neat and tidy of the your kitchen. 【Multipurpose Use】550ml large capacity cooking oil bottle can hold up to 18oz of oil, wide mouth allows you to easily refill oil without the need for a funnel. the transparent glass bottle allows visualization of the remaining oil in the bottle. This glass oil dropper and brush bottle can hold a variety of liquid condiments such as olive oil, vinegar, soy sauce, cooking wine, lemon juice, perfect for Salad making, Cooking, Baking, Pickling, Barbecue, Frying, Marinating, Roasting, Grilling. 【Easy to Clean】Each part of the bottle can be disassembled and cleaned, you can easily clean the oil and vinegar bottle with the included sponge cleaning brush. This oil brush with glass bottle can also be used alone, and comes with an additional silicone brush, it is very convenient to apply ketchup, chocolate sauce, and peanut butter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ljr6bfE1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pawcute","source_asin":"B0B76BCN4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B76BCN4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B76BCN4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
