window.products.push({"id":494292,"name":"Garden Of Arts Rolling Pin Belan for Kitchen Use used mainly for Roti Chapati flour and it will make flat rotis also known as Rolling Pin patla belan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21eehul9JqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Dimensions: Length - 14 inches x Width - 1.00 inches x Height - 1.00 inches. A tapered style polished rolling pin made from one solid piece of wood to make rolling out dough easy. With thin curved edge ends and large thickness centre you can roll with minimum pressure applied. Being made of one of the most safe materials, it will last you a long time and you will be able to make tasty even sized or thickness chapati, parathas, pastry, pizza bases or even flatbreads for parties, gatherings or even for professional catering services. Have Control While Rolling Out - Gain more control and have even rolled out dough in minutes. This wooden rolling pin has a tapered structure where the centre is thick and the ends are thinner. The thinner ends will provide firm grip and allow you to apply even and controlled pressure to the centre of the rolling pin so that you can have even distribution of dough and to any preffered thickness. The thicker centre also ensures that you do not have to apply much pressure. Minimal Cleaning Worries - The more care you take of an item, the longer is lasts. This wooden rolling pin is purely made from one solid piece of wood. Top to bottom, this wooden rolling pin does not have any joints. Being made from a single piece of wood will ensure that there is no residue dough or flour stuck on the rolling pin. This will enable the rolling pin to be cleaned easily and you will not have to worry about it getting damaged from built up residue or water. Most Safe Material To Use - This wooden rolliing pin is also needed in your utensil collection because it does not affect any food being rolled out. This wooden rolling pin will not react or filtrate any harmful chemicals when in contact with dough or many other foods. This ensures that you can safely roll out food without it or its flavours being affected.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21eehul9JqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Garden Of Arts","source_asin":"B07RRHYY2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RRHYY2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RRHYY2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
