window.products.push({"id":494358,"name":"BHeadCat Toothbrush Holders Wall Mounted, Toothbrush Holder with Automatic Toothpaste Dispensers, 6 Brush Slots, 2 Magnetic Cups,1 Cosmetic Drawer Org","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rr656qk2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"❤ 2 AUTOMATIC TOOTHPASTE DISPENSERS: The toothbrush holder kit comes with 2 auto toothpaste squeezers, which squeeze out perfect amount of toothpaste each time, preventing waste of toothpaste. Dual auto toothpaste squeezers for adult and children's separate toothpaste. Adult and children use different toothpastes. Having dual toothpaste dispensers, will be much more convenient. The toothpaste dispensers are detachable, easy and convenient to clean. ❤ HIGH QUALITY & ENVIRONMENT FRIENDLY: The wall mounted toothbrush holder made of high standard ABS material, sleek outlook, no smell, toxic free. We stand behind the quality of our products and high level customer services. Any question, please contact us. ❤ LARGE CAPACITY SPACE SAVING STORAGE TROY: Toothbrush holders for bathrooms accommodates 2 cups for family use with 6 toothbrushes. Can place razor, shaver, facial cleaner and cosmetic on top. Moreover, an organizer drawer is designed to storage cosmetic accessories. The whole collection is for multi-functional storage usages. ❤ UPSIDE-DOWN MAGNETIC CUP DESIGN: Toothpaste holder with 2 cups use upside-down cup design for fast water draining. The cups are securely attached to the holder, never falling down and easy to pick up. The brush slots for Quickly drain, effectively keep toothbrushes dry and clean, safer and healthier. Children enjoy brushing teeth more with these interesting magnetic cups. ❤ EASY NO-DRILL PUNCH FREE INSTALLATION: Bathroom toothbrush holder wall mounted no need to drill holes on wall. Wipe the smooth surface with wet cloth and make it dry thoroughly. Apply the traceless stickers and wait 24 hours before hanging the toothbrush holder. The toothpaste dispenser kit makes your bathroom in order and organized. Please be noted that the adhesive sticker only work on surface like smooth tiles, mirror and smooth wooden surface. Painted walls are not supported.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rr656qk2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BHeadCat","source_asin":"B08ML1YKB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ML1YKB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ML1YKB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
