window.products.push({"id":494398,"name":"GROSCHE Chicago Steel Infuser Bottle, tea infuser flask, infuser water bottle thermos, Insulated Stainless Steel flask with tea infuser (Black, 16 fl ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HRSiRBhWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐ [ 5 in 1 Multifunction insulated water bottle ] The Chicago Steel is a 16 fl oz insulated water bottle infuser that can do so many things. You can use it as a insulated coffee mug , as a tea diffuser for loose tea with the included tea infuser for loose tea, iced tea, or as a infusion water bottle for fruit infused water, as a cold brew or iced coffee tumbler or just as a great travel mug ⭐ [ 18.8 insulated double walled stainless steel water bottle ] This thermal flask is vacuum insulated to keep your tea or coffee hot (upto 12 hrs) or your iced coffee or infused water cold (upto 24 hrs). It makes a great travel mug as it fits standard cup holders. Its a great travel coffee tumbler as it holds 16 oz (Grande size) and keeps your coffee or tea hot when you're on the go. ⭐ [ Ideal travel mug and tea mug with infuser ] If you are a lover of loose leaf tea and would like a travel tea infuser mug for loose lea then this is the ideal flask for you. The included two part stainless steel tea infuser can be used to steep loose leaf tea, tea bags, or even as a fruit infuser water bottle . The infuser is large to give your loose leaf tea leaves ample space to expand as they steep to give you a great tea infusion. The insulated thermos will keep your tea hot. ⭐ [ Infuser water bottle for home or office ] The included stainless steel infuser is ideal to make fruit infused water. Just add your fruit in the flask, add water, and add in the strainer then close the lid. The fruit will infuse in your insulated water bottle, and the strainer will filter it as you drink. Just add more water or ice to the fruit and you can enjoy it all day at home, at work, or on the go. ⭐ [ Ideal Grande size coffee mug with easy sip lid ] This insulated coffee mug is sized to hold a Grande sized coffee for you to enjoy. The BPA Free lid is designed to be easy sipping and easy to carry with the hook style handle on the lid. The lid is dishwasher safe but we recommend hand washing the flask as dishwasher detergent can hard the matte paint colors of the Chicago Steel infuser flask.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HRSiRBhWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GROSCHE","source_asin":"B09S6V68RP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S6V68RP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S6V68RP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
