window.products.push({"id":494540,"name":"BEST CULINARY TORCH, Perfect for Making Creme Brûlée, Smores, Roasting Vegetables, Caramelizes Sugar on Pies & Fruit on Cakes, Jewelry Repair & Lighti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51imawkq3ZL._AC_.jpg","description":"BRINGING FAMILIES TOGETHER AGAIN AT A FULL MEASURE MARKET, OUR GOAL IS TO HELP YOUR FAMILY LOVE EACH OTHER MORE THAN EVER. Sounds crazy for a kitchen tool company, right? Well, maybe, but we love to see families laughing around a table full of great food. EASY. EASY. EASY.  You’re going to love the fact that your torch doesn’t need you to turn on the fuel before you press the knob to get the flame lit. Here’s what one customer said: “I have hand issues, arthritis, CMC joint damage etc. I found I was still able to put enough pressure to turn it on without much discomfort (this is also why I love the option for continuous flame lock as it saves my thumb & fingers when doing a bigger project like lemon meringue pie.)” WE’VE SEARCHED THE GLOBE, AND THIS KITCHEN TORCH IS THE BEST.  It’s 7” tall, has a 5” wide head, and a 3” wide permanent base, so you never need to dig through the junk drawer looking for the stand. This butane torch is constructed for the long haul. ARE YOUR CHILDREN CURIOUS LIKE OURS? Probably, we’d guess. Your torch features a child safety lock so that the easy press trigger isn’t pressed too easily by the small set of fingers at your house. IF YOU CAN’T FIND IT, LOOK IN THE SHOP Since this culinary torch can be used for soldering, melting rope ends, lighting tiki torches and camp fires, it may not ever return to it’s happy spot on your counter! ENJOY OUR “BEST QUALITY GUARANTEE” WITH YOUR PURCHASE. If you aren’t completely satisfied with the high performance of your Culinary Torch, we will offer you a full refund with no questions asked. We are confident that you are going to love every minute with our top rated Cooking Blow Torch, and you’ll be wondering how you ever got along without it! Add Our Culinary Torch To Your Cart Today, and Consider Ordering One For Your Best Friend!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51imawkq3ZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A Full Measure Market","source_asin":"B017L8MJL6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017L8MJL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017L8MJL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
