window.products.push({"id":494679,"name":"LIFEWEAR Placemat Set of 6,Woven Placemats,Outdoor/Indoor Placemats,Vinyl/Plastic Placemats,Washable Placemats,Table Placemats Set of 6（Smoky Grey）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ILBurKAjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MODERN AND SLEEK: LIFEWEAR placemats with attractive and elegant design are easy to dress up or down, depending on your needs. The style of woven placemats is super popular right now. Placemats set of 6 are available in a wide range of colors, so you can easily find an option that coordinates with your dining room or kitchen décor. You can also find table placemats set of 6 that feature patterns in multiple colors. TRUSTED QUALITY: These vinyl placemats are eco-friendly and made from high-grade vinyl composed of 70 percent PVC and 30 percent polyester. Tightly woven vinyl is durable and does a good job of protecting your dinning table surfaces from scratches, rings, and heat. In particular, LIFEWEAR placemat sets are applied a creative thermal-cutting technology during the manufacturing, avoid to get frayed at the edges, so that they can be more durable and last for longer than the competitors! EASY CARE: These washable placemats are pretty easy CARE, you can just wipe them with a wet cloth if there's any spots on it. They can usually be washed by hand with water and dish soap, though it’s important to air dry them thoroughly to and other water damage. For the red tomato-based spots like ketchup and spaghetti/pizza sauce, suggest to rinse placemats under faucet and soak them in sink for minutes, scrub them with a brush and they look like new! WORTH YOUR MONEY: For everyday use, it’s good to have at least two sets for your entire household, particularly if they’re made of fabric and need to be machine washed. That means you’ll always have a set ready when you’re sitting down to a meal. If you opt for vinyl or plastic mats, though, one set is usually enough. Lifewear outdoor placemats contain 6 pieces of placemat, only cost you $2.5/count to create an exquisite feeling at the meal time. Really affordable and worth your money! SHAPE AND SIZE: The shape is mainly a decorative concern for most customers, rectangular table placemats are usually the most preferred/common option, can be suitable for both casual and formal occasions, match your wooden table, marble table, glass table, kitchen table and picnic table. Lifewear table placemats are typically 12 by 18 inches in size. The size is a more functional issue, can fit your dinner plates and any other items you want on the surface of the mats!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ILBurKAjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFEWEAR","source_asin":"B0B1Q9HXHX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1Q9HXHX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1Q9HXHX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
