window.products.push({"id":494843,"name":"Giantex Dining Table with Bench, Wooden 3 Pcs Kitchen Dining Room Furniture for 4, Modern Studio Collection Table Set with 2 Benches, Dinette Set, Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L+lmx7W6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"『Perfect Combination Accommodates 4 Persons』: The dining set includes 1 rectangular table and 2 long benches, which can accommodate 2-4 persons to fulfill your basic dining requirement. Meanwhile, the benches can be stored under the table when not in use, to save much more space, which is specially designed to meet the need of those who live in a small apartment. 『Wide Tabletop with Smooth Surface』: The tabletop is large enough to keep your beautiful cutleries and fresh flowers. It is capable of catering to your family members and guests, freeing you from narrow dining space. Also, its smooth surface brings much more convenience in daily clean-up while enabling a comfortable dining experience. 『Natural Acacia Wood for Lasting Durability』: It is the selected material that makes the dining set stand out. Delicately made of high-quality natural acacia wood, the table legs as well as bench legs show perfect performance in lasting durability and great load-bearing capacity. 500 lbs weight capacity of a single bench provides ultra-reliable support for each individual. 『Simple Assembly & Solid Connection』: So simple structure is that there is no need to worry about how to put all parts together. Detailed instruction helps a lot. More, its solid connection will be not difficult to find when you install this dining set. The sturdy structure with the thickened board will never let you down, for many years of enjoyment. 『Modern Design for Wide Range of Use』: Can not only this table set serve to be a dining set, but also be used as a kitchen food prep workstation or a study table for your kids. You can maximize its usage as per your preference. Additionally, its modern design makes it possible to match well with different styles, either for home use or commercial use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L+lmx7W6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B08KFFHZ5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KFFHZ5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KFFHZ5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
