window.products.push({"id":494846,"name":"VAEHOLD Wall Spice Rack, Free Standing Tiered Acrylic Spice Rack for Countertop, Clear Wall Mounted Spice Rack Organizer Spice Wall Holder for Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mkz1TbeIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wall spice rack assembly: 1. Open the package and get all the parts. 2. Remove the protective film of the parts. 3. Placing the side panel on a flat surface, put rectangular Storage trough between the side panels according to the hole position. 4. Install all the screws and tighten the nuts. 5. Finished. Get a complete wall spice rack. Tips: 1. You can insert the screw from the inside of the rectangular Storage trough and screw the nuts outside the trough, which may help you better assemble the wall spice rack. And then tighten the nuts inside the trough. It may be more difficult for people with larger hands to install. it may take some patience when installing. Install to the wall: 1. Mark the wall with the side panels before assembling. 2. Drill holes depth around 1\" at the marked location on the wall(use a 1/4 twist drill bit) 3. Hit the wall anchor into the hole with a hammer and cut off the over-length from the wall surface. 4. Align the assembled wall-mounted spice rack with the holes on the wall and tighten the screws. It's very multipurpose: 1. More space. The three-story design has a larger capacity and can store small items such as spices in the storage room to make it look neat and orderly. 2. The spice storage rack is very useful and easy-to-view storage content. This shelf allows you to see everything perfectly! You can get the items you need accurately without worrying about knocking over or mistaken the bottle next to it. 3. Clean look. The clear acrylic is easy to see the spice jar or other item labels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mkz1TbeIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VAEHOLD","source_asin":"B093GPTSSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093GPTSSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093GPTSSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
