window.products.push({"id":494860,"name":"TANSUNG Chef Knife 8\" Pro Kitchen Knife Ultra Sharp Cutting Cooking Knife with Durable Stainless Steel Nonstick Blade Ergonomic Handle Protective Shea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i090mvjQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍎🍊【HIGH QUALITY STAINLESS STEEL CHEF KNIFE】TANSUNG kitchen knife is made from high quality 5Cr15MoV stainless steel, sharper and harder comparing with others. High-tech craftsmanship production prevents the knife from rusting, corroding and sticking. Don’t worry the blade will fade or tarnish after long-term tough tasks any more. Mysterious blackness makes life more delicate. Tip: Any problems or doubts for item, please contact us and we will surely give you a good solution. 🍉🥝【REMARKABLE DESIGN & PROTECTIVE SHEATH】 The weight and the size of our professional chef knife feels quite balanced, this pro-grade kitchen knife won’t slide off your hands, can help you slashing down cutting time and saving your fingers painful injuries with ergonomic handle. Attached with double protective sheath, better to protect kitchen knife ensuring knife’s long-lasting usage. 🥩🧀【UNIQUE ABS SANDBLASTING ERGONOMIC HANDLE】The ergonomic handle is made of ABS stable material. Sandblasting technology makes our handle anti-slip and anti-rust, no fingerprint or other trace whenever you use. The steel design at the bottom of the handle makes our knife more fashionable. The chef knife is specialized in home and restaurants’ kitchens. 🥒🌶【PERFECT PERFORMANCE】Our cooking knife is is perfect for cutting ,dicing ,slicing ,chopping vegetable, fruit, meat, cheese, herbs etc. A good knife is the best companion for your stress-free cooking time. The knife is easy to clean, hand wash is better. Please dry it with cloth after washing. 🍕🍔【EXPRESSION OF LOVE AS A GIFT】 TANSUNG ultra sharp kitchen knife with 100% after-sale warranty is the the best gift for your parents, lovers, friends and those who love cooking. Choose it and enjoy your gourmet with your friends or families. Any problems or advice, please contact us at any time. Our TANSUNG team is always committed to providing the most satisfying service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i090mvjQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TANSUNG","source_asin":"B0BF9BHG9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF9BHG9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF9BHG9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":494861,"name":"Hands-Free 54mm Dosing Funnel for Breville Barista Portafilters For Breville 8 Series Anodized Aluminum (Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rS-P0P3dS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SUITABLE FOR 54mm BREVLLE PORTAFILTER】 Designed to work with the Breville 54mm Portafilter baskets including Breville / Sage Barista Series BES880, BES878, BES875, BES870, BES840, BES810, BES500, Barista Express, Barista Touch, Barista Pro, Infuser, Duo Temp pro. 【HANDS-FREE DESIGN】 This dosing funnel is well constructed and works perfectly on the Breville 54mm portafilter. With a twisting lock, it attaches securely and is easy to connect and remove. There are grooves that are meant to slide into the chute, then the front tap auto-activates the grinder for a perfect dose. 【AVOID MESS AND WASTE】 A Coffee Dosing Ring stops wasting coffee and prevents messes on your work top. With a coffee dosing funnel, all the coffee goes into the portafilter basket and significantly reduces the mess and difficulty in loading and tamping. Using this dosing ring makes it easier to tamp or distribute without spilling when the portafilter basket is overflowing with a heap of grounds. 【AUTO GRIND AND EASY TO TAMP】 With this dosing ring, you can activate the grinder with its front tap, allowing your machine’s auto dose feature to work as intended. The ring's inside size is 54mm the same as portafilter. You can tamp with the dosing ring on. It will not block the tamper. From grinding to tamping the dosing ring can keep coffee from falling out. 【REMOVE BEFORE BREWING】 This dosing funnel is NOT water tight with portafilter. Remember to remove the dosing funnel ring after the tamping and before the extraction. Do not lock the dosing ring on the brewing tap.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rS-P0P3dS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Okydoky","source_asin":"B096M674YL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096M674YL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096M674YL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
