window.products.push({"id":494865,"name":"KidKraft Wooden Farmhouse Table & 4 Chairs Set, Children's Furniture for Arts and Activity, Espresso, Gift for Ages 3-8 23.6 x 23.6 x 19 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":96.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SW1njflcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Every child needs their own workspace. Sized just right for them, the durable and good-looking KidKraft Farmhouse Table & 4 Chair Set is the perfect place for up to four kids to play a game, enjoy a snack or simply visit. Simply and classically designed, it will look great in a playroom, bedroom or living area. Made of wood and with a traditional espresso finish, this set fits in anywhere. Rounded corners provided extra safety. Easy to assemble, this is the ideal children's furniture piece to last through many happy moments. From the Manufacturer KidKraft’s Farmhouse Table and 4-Chair Set provides kids with a space perfect for playing board games, working on homework and much more. Table: 23.6\" x 23.6\" x 18\"H Chairs: 11\" x 11.6\" x 21\"H (seat 10.8\"H)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SW1njflcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KidKraft","source_asin":"B0BLXTLH4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLXTLH4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLXTLH4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":494866,"name":"LinenTablecloth 15-Inch Polyester Napkins (1-Dozen) Black & White Checker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MFMq4WFsL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Match these Checkered Napkins with their corresponding Checkered tablecloths - or not. Who says you can't combine a red and white Checkered tablecloth with 15 inch black and white Checkered napkins? Will the Checkered table linen police show up beside your picnic tablecloth? Like all of our Checkered table linens, the Checkered napkins are made of woven polyester, so they're durable, wrinkle and stain resistant, and can be washed numerous times and still maintain their Checkered glory! Pair these napkins with any of our napkin rings for that additional touch of elegance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MFMq4WFsL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LTC LINENS","source_asin":"B008TKWN5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008TKWN5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008TKWN5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":494867,"name":"Vasofe Soft Fluffy Area Rug for Bedroom, 3x5 Shag Living Room Rugs Black Plush Carpets for Boys Kids Room, Anti-Slip Durable Bedside Throw for Nursery","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713pX68QCzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience a Luxurious and Comfortable Feel - Our shaggy rug boasts a thick, high pile that offers a soft and silky touch, making it perfect for lounging or crawling on. The fluffy area rug adds a pop of color to any room and creates a cozy, inviting atmosphere that's perfect for snuggling up on cold winter nights. High-Quality Material for Long-Lasting Durability - Our shag rugs are crafted from premium, high-density polypropylene fibers that are odorless and won't shed, ensuring they stay looking and feeling like new for longer. They're also stain-resistant, making them ideal for everyday indoor use. Non-Slip Backing - Our soft fuzzy living room rugs feature a sturdy backing made up of thousands of plastic silicone anti-slip points, ensuring they stay in place even on slippery surfaces. This design is soundproof and offers extra cushioning underfoot, making it ideal for families with young children or pets. Durable and Easy to Maintain - Our furry rugs are built to withstand the wear and tear of daily use, making them perfect for busy households and those who entertain frequently. They're easy to care for and require minimal maintenance, so you can enjoy their softness and beauty for years to come. Easy to Maintain - To keep your rug looking its best, simply lay this washable rug flat for a few days to smooth out any creases, and use a vacuum cleaner on the lowest setting for daily care. For deeper cleaning, machine wash on a gentle cycle with mild detergent and tumble dry on low. Versatile Design that Suits Any Room - Our bedroom carpets offer a range of area rugs that are perfect for all indoor spaces, from living rooms and bedrooms to offices, dorms, nursery. With beautifully designed patterns, our kids rugs can tie multiple rooms together and create the illusion of more space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713pX68QCzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vasofe","source_asin":"B08CKRL3K2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CKRL3K2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CKRL3K2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":494868,"name":"Green Ace ® 6oz American Flag Flask Gift Set in Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WN3B2TnFL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"An ideal gift suitable for many special occasions, anniversaries and other important dates. The flask itself is made of high quality stainless steel and with an American Flag design on faux leather wrap. The funnel assists in pouring and adds convenience. The two shot cups allow for easy drinking, sharing, and having the best of times. This set includes everything needed for the fullest flask enjoyment.  Set Includes:  6 oz. Stainless Steel Flask with an American Flag design  2 Stainless Steel Shot Cups  1 Stainless Steel Funnel  Dimensions of Flask: 4.5\" (Height) x 4.0\" (Width) x 1.0\" (Depth), Weight: 0.8 pounds","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WN3B2TnFL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Green Ace","source_asin":"B00G57U7AK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G57U7AK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G57U7AK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":494869,"name":"Open Top Storage Bin with Handles (Tan)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91UJqwr1nnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With an open top design and a sturdy rectangular shape, this storage bin makes a lovely addition to any room in the home. The Open Top Storage Bin with Handles Teal by Raymond Waites features a traditional woven basket weave design with a flat bottom and cut out handles on each side that make it easy to carry from room to room. The soft shade of teal blue gives this storage bin a versatile look that makes it as perfect for use in a shabby chic country cottage as it does in an urban apartment outfitted with contemporary furniture and eclectic decorative accents. The open top design allows you to store everything from small accessories to oversized, bulky items. This open top storage bin can be used in a child’s bedroom or a playroom as a place to store stuffed animals, toys and games, seasonal clothing, or art supplies. In a family room or a living room, this storage bin offers a stylish way to hold everything from sewing and knitting supplies to books and magazines to dog toys and pet blankets or mail and miscellaneous household items. In a bedroom, use this bin as a convenient place to stash accessories such as belts and scarves, small handbags and wristlets, DVDs and video games, or files and documents that you just can’t throw away. The open top design makes it perfect for easy cleanups and allows you to keep clutter at bay in an organized, stylish way. The pretty shade of blue gives this storage bin a charming, vintage-inspired look and blends beautifully into any room with shabby chic décor, rustic accents, traditional furniture, or contemporary styling. Place two or three bins together to allow for an even greater, and more fashionable, storage solution in your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91UJqwr1nnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Raymond Waites","source_asin":"B00TYVC5NG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TYVC5NG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TYVC5NG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
