window.products.push({"id":494920,"name":"60\" Round Tempered Glass Table Top 1/2\" Thick Ogee Edge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O2QYlgnBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"60\" ROUND GLASS TOPS Features: Finest quality furniture glass Edges and corners expertly polished Expertly packed to ensure safe arrival Glass is individually cartoned with styrofoam protection Free bumpons included to place between glass tops & base Tempered at no additional cost 60\" ROUND GLASS TOPSThis clear 60\" Round glass tabletop is made from the finest quality furniture glass. There are several options available for this size. It is available in a pencil edge that is tempered and has a weight of 120 lbs. A slightly thicker glass option is the ¾\" thickness which is available in the same 1\" beveled edging, flat polish and ogee, having a weight of 225 lbs. The edges of the glass are expertly polished to ensure a bright, smooth to the touch feel.Give your old dining room an instant make over with this crystal clear glass top. This round glass top is perfect to use as a replacement glass top or can be used to create a contemporary decorative glass dining table. Also, this clear glass top is perfect as a table protector. The 60\" Round size glass top will comfortably seat 8 people. Glass top tables are extremely popular since they can easily match with a variety of styles, home decor and compliment the atmosphere of a space. This is a perfect addition to your dining room and is very durable & easy to clean. These beautiful glass tops are available in many sizes, thicknesses and edgework.All of our round glass tops includes free bumpons to place in between the glass and base of the table. They are professionally packed and individually packaged with Styrofoam to protect from breakage during transit. The 60\" clear round glass table top ships quickly and is also insured to ensure a safe arrival.Shopping for Round Glass Tops online is easy at Glass Tops Direct. We feature many variations in size, shape, thickness and edge work as well as custom glass sizes. We feature different glass strengths depending on thickness. Whether you are purchasing a glass top as a","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O2QYlgnBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spancraft Glass","source_asin":"B001E685WY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001E685WY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001E685WY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":494921,"name":"DSKENU Enhanced 24K Gold Rose with Love Picture Frame & Greeting Card, A Giftable Rose Crafts That Never Withers, Romantic Gift for Her on Anniversary","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vb6UIn3hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⌚ Own the Eternal Beauty: Fresh flowers are easy to wither with short florescence. But our gilded roses can blossom forever with eternal beauty. Gilded rose is also a new and unique choice for you compared to fresh roses because we can consume less fresh flowers and highlight the values and arts with more sense of gifting ritual. Our gilded roses are made of real flowers with artificial artistic treatments, such as trimming, color fixing, resin wrapping, 24k gold plating and reshaping, etc. ✔ Sense of Gifting Ritual: Our gilded roses are specially designed as high-end gifts equipped with exclusively customized gift boxes. Unique locking mechanism, high-grade golden brushed surface, irregular spot texture and embossed rose pattern make our gift box dazzling with sense of beauty and rich details. More design details are also included in the box, such as the heart-shaped envelop and greeting card, the tray, the certificate and the white mesh bag. 📷 Enjoy the Fun of Customized DIY: Our gilded rose can serve as unique ornament in collocation with the heart-shaped frame as shown in the photo, which can be used as a stand to place the rose, an artistic photo frame or even a graffiti plate. You can remove the magnetic acrylic plate on the back and tailor your own photos by referring to the heart-shaped pattern we provided, then align and clamp the photos with the removed magnetic acrylic plate. 🎁 Universal Gift for All Ladies: For male buyers, our gilded rose can serve as an anniversary gift to your wife, a birthday gift to your girlfriend, especially as a Valentine's Day gift for her. For all buyers, if you give it to female elders, it would be the best gift for your mother or grandma on Women’s Day and Mother’s Day, even Valentine's Day. If you don’t know how to give gifts to women, you can’t go wrong with our gilded rose. 🚚 Considerate After-sales Service: Unsatisfied with the product? Product received is damaged? Please contact our customer service any time and our professional staff will respond to you with good solutions. All our products are picked and delivered from Amazon warehouse and they will also inspect the products before shipment. However, due to various uncontrollable factors during transportation, if you have received a damaged product, please feel free to contact us for a new one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vb6UIn3hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DSKENU","source_asin":"B09S51Y2C6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S51Y2C6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S51Y2C6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
