window.products.push({"id":494943,"name":"Walker Edison Mid Century Modern Eames Upholstered Dining Chair Faux Leather","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wEhJjJhfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These trendy, upholstered Eames chairs will create the perfect combination of retro and contemporary, with a mid century modern look, to any room of your home. Featuring a tufted upholstered back and solid wood legs reinforced by a steel frame, these chairs are both durable and attractive. Perfect for a home office chair, accent chair, kitchen or dining chair for comfortable, stylish seating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wEhJjJhfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Walker Edison","source_asin":"B077MMCR5G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077MMCR5G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077MMCR5G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":494944,"name":"BALDR Digital Alarm Clock for Bedroom - Flip On/Off Reversible LCD Screen - Big Time Display - White Backlit - Battery Operated - Great for Kids, Heav","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RKahlypDS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"No More Search For Button To Stop The Morning Alarm - Our unique FLIP design allows you simply turn the clock over and the alarm / snooze will be deactivated. The alarm clock is reversible, one side displays the alarm and time, flip it over to the other side, the alarm will be deactivated and it only displays the current time. Easy Setting with One Rotary Dial - Simple yet efficient, one button does it all. Press to start setups, Rotate to adjust the value. The big symbols of ALARM / ALARM OFF on both sides remind you if the alarm is on or off, no more accidents to wake up at the wrong time! When the alarm rings, touch the top and it will snooze in 5 minute intervals. Big Numbers Provide Clear View at Night - With a size of 4.2” x 1.1” & display screen 3.15” x 0.63”, the digital alarm clock is small, convenient and practical. The numbers are big and clear, 8 seconds backlight allows you to check the time in the dark without keeping you awake. It Is Also A Flashlight - This flip digital alarm clock does not only function as a clock but also as an illuminator. Press the button on the back and it serves as a flashlight! No more search for lights, it is always there on your nightstand. Great for checking out kids at night, or in power outages. Portable Stylish & Battery Powered - Powered by 2x AAA batteries (Not included), the alarm clock can be used anywhere. Its modern design ensures a look that is clean, portable & stylish. Perfect in bedrooms, kids rooms, classrooms, campings, workouts, or a must have for travelers & heavy sleepers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RKahlypDS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALDR","source_asin":"B08G8F38VD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G8F38VD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G8F38VD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":494945,"name":"SP Images Inc. I Love Boston Sports 16x20 Wall Print - The Last Suppah","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gaILXom9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is an item that is 2 1/2 years in the making. We started this undertaking with the intent of celebrating notable Boston Sports events over the last century. In fact, the original name of this was supposed to be \"The Last Century.\" It was meant to be a conversation piece making mention of highlights (and low points..ahem '86 World Series) of our rich history. Call us crazy or call us inspired .. but after numerous revisions and wasted effort, we finalized our direction and it started to come together. Many of our initial ideas had to be scrapped in favor of new ones, but in the end we think we nailed it...but that is for YOU to decide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gaILXom9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SP Images Inc.","source_asin":"B01E0EPL2I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E0EPL2I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E0EPL2I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
