window.products.push({"id":494988,"name":"Umbra Cubby Mini Organizer – with Hooks and Compartment, Great for Holding Keys, Phone, Chargers, Mail, and Oher Goods, Compact Storage, White 12-1/2 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fRfIJPcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Misplacing your keys, phone, or mail is very frustrating, especially when you’re on the way out of the house. With this stylish and clever organizer from Umbra, you can make keeping your grab-and-go items organized much simpler. Introducing Cubby Mini by Umbra Cubby Mini by Umbra is a compact organizer that will serve you well at your front door or another space in your home where you would like to keep essentials on hand and organized. This piece has a compartment great for objects like mail, phones, chargers, and wallets. Its flip-down hooks are good for keys and they neatly flip back up when not in use. Here’s Why Amazon Customers Love Cubby Mini “We keep a neat, minimalist household - however, like every family, we have some things that end up in a small pile in the entryway - keys, address labels, stamps, etc. I wanted a wall mounted organizer (we have a very grabby 2 yr old), preferably with dry erase message board. I looked for weeks but they were usually too big, stuck out too far, and really expensive. I ended up purchasing this small organizer, and adding a $5.00 dry erase board on top - very happy with the results. This is a nice, chic, practical solution for our entryway, great value for the price.” Details Compact is size, this organizer will keep your items stored neatly without taking up a lot of space on your wall. It measures 10 ½ x 3 x 2 inches (26.7 x 7.6 x 5.1 cm). Cubby Mini is made of wood with steel hooks and comes in your choice of white, natural and black/walnut. Streamline the gathering of your essentials and other goods by ordering the Cubby Mini today. About Umbra: A global product design company providing original, modern, casual, functional, and affordable design for the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fRfIJPcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B01M66LYPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-494988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M66LYPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M66LYPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
